The databases contain data from the following sources:

* IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)
  DB-IP IP to City Lite and IP to ASN Lite, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The data has been merged
  with the sources below and modified.

* GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org)
  Place names, identifiers and coordinates in data/cn_admin.csv and
  data/cn_cities.csv, licensed under CC BY 4.0.

* iptoasn.com by Frank Denis (https://iptoasn.com)
  IP to ASN data, Open Data Commons Public Domain Dedication and License
  (PDDL) 1.0.

* Network lists published by Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, Microsoft
  Azure, Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, Cloudflare and Fastly. These lists do
  not state a license; they are used as factual references to flag CDN,
  anycast and cloud networks.

Web applications that display or use lookup results must include the link
<a href='https://db-ip.com'>IP Geolocation by DB-IP</a> on those pages.

